    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομνησ-τέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must remind,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.70
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must warn,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.383
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must make mention,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1436b29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must provoke,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐκκρίσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
				</span></i>
			
			
				Med.
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.75
			</span></i>.</div>
